cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CandyConc in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: CandyConc
abstract: >-
  CandyConc is a local corpus analysis application: a KWIC concordancer with
  its own corpus index and CQP-style query language, corpus statistics with
  method records, document context, metadata-based subcorpora, exports with
  provenance, and an optional research copilot that calls the same analysis
  operations.
authors:
  - family-names: Ruppert
    given-names: Michael
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/miweru/CandyConc"
url: "https://github.com/miweru/CandyConc"
keywords:
  - corpus linguistics
  - concordancer
  - KWIC
  - CQP
  - collocation
  - keyness
